<title>RUSSIA: Russian '96 net grain harvest 69.0 mln T - Committee.</title>
<headline>Russian '96 net grain harvest 69.0 mln T - Committee.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-12-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia harvested a net 69.0 million tonnes of grain in 1996, according to revised preliminary data, after 63.4 million tonnes in 1995, State Statistics Committee figures released on Sunday said.</p>
<p>Agriculture Minister Viktor Khlystun said on December 10 that the 1996 net grain harvest was 68.4 million tonnes.</p>
<p>The committee said the average net harvest between 1991 and 1995 was 88.0 million tonnes.</p>
<p>On November 1 it released preliminary data showing that the 1996 gross grain harvest was 74.6 million tonnes after 68.9 million tonnes in 1995.</p>
<p>-- Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
